<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Free Poker Tools — ACESLIVEPH</title>
<meta name="description" content="Free poker tools for live and online players: Pot odds, outs to equity, tournament ROI, bankroll calculator, variance simulator, Kelly criterion, effective stack." />
<link rel="canonical" href="https://acesliveph.com/tools" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0a" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0a0a; --surface: #161616; --surface-2: #1c1c1c;
    --border: #262626; --border-2: #333333;
    --text: #ffffff; --text-2: #b0b0b0; --text-3: #6b6b6b;
    --orange: #F7931A; --orange-2: #d97f15;
    --gold: #c9a227; --green: #4ade80; --red: #ef4444;
  }
  * { -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  html, body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; }
  .font-serif { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .font-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .orange { color: var(--orange); }
  .gold { color: var(--gold); }
  .text-2 { color: var(--text-2); }
  .text-3 { color: var(--text-3); }
  .surface { background: var(--surface); }
  .border-soft { border-color: var(--border); }
  .promo-strip { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #4a2a05 50%, #0a0a0a 100%); }
  .nav-link { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-2); }
  .nav-link:hover { color: var(--orange); }
  .nav-link.active { color: var(--orange); }
  .btn-orange { background: var(--orange); color: #0a0a0a; font-weight: 700; transition: all 0.18s; border: 1px solid var(--orange); cursor: pointer; }
  .btn-orange:hover { background: var(--orange-2); border-color: var(--orange-2); }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border-2); transition: all 0.18s; cursor: pointer; }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--orange); color: var(--orange); }
  .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); transition: border 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--orange); }
  .tool-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.75rem; }
  .tool-card.featured { border-left: 4px solid var(--orange); }

  /* Form inputs */
  .field { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .field label { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .field input, .field select { width: 100%; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border-2); color: var(--text); padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--orange); }
  .field-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .field-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .field-help { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: 0.25rem; }

  /* Result */
  .result { background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid rgba(247,147,26,0.3); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .result-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-3); }
  .result-value { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--orange); margin-top: 0.25rem; }
  .result-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .result-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .result-extra { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 0.25rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }

  /* Tabs */
  .tab-bar { display: flex; gap: 2px; background: var(--surface); padding: 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tab-btn { flex: 1; min-width: 110px; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; background: transparent; color: var(--text-2); border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .tab-btn.active { background: var(--orange); color: #0a0a0a; }
  .tab-btn:not(.active):hover { color: var(--text); }
  .tab-content { display: none; }
  .tab-content.active { display: block; }

  /* Distribution bars (variance simulator) */
  .dist-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .dist-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .dist-bar { flex: 1; height: 6px; background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
  .dist-bar > div { height: 100%; background: var(--orange); }
  .dist-bar.green > div { background: var(--green); }
  .dist-bar.red > div { background: var(--red); }
  .dist-percentile { width: 60px; color: var(--text-3); }
  .dist-value { width: 110px; text-align: right; color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .divider { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-2), transparent); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Promo strip -->
<div class="promo-strip text-center text-xs py-2 text-2">
  <span class="hidden sm:inline">📨</span> Subscribe to the newsletter and get the
  <span class="orange font-semibold">free quarterly digest</span> delivered to your inbox
</div>

<!-- Header -->
<header class="border-b border-soft sticky top-0 z-50" style="background: rgba(10,10,10,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <div class="font-serif text-2xl orange leading-none">A</div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-sm tracking-[0.18em] leading-none">ACESLIVE<span class="orange">PH</span></div>
        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.20em] text-3 mt-1">The #1 Poker Hub of the Philippines</div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-2">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">News</a>
      <a href="/rooms" class="hover:text-white">Rooms</a>
      <a href="/poker-sites" class="hover:text-white">Online</a>
      <a href="/tournaments" class="hover:text-white">Tourneys</a>
      <a href="/poy" class="hover:text-white">POY</a>
      <a href="/tools" class="hover:text-white">Tools</a>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="btn-ghost text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded">Home</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-8 text-center">
  <div class="label mb-4">Free Forever · No Login · No Paywall</div>
  <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] mb-4">
    Poker tools, <span class="orange">free.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="text-base text-2 max-w-xl mx-auto">
    The full toolkit every live poker player needs. No accounts, no nonsense.
    Pick a tool below or scroll through them all.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- Tool tabs -->
<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20">
  <div class="tab-bar">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="pot-odds">Pot Odds</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="outs">Outs → Equity</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="roi">Tournament ROI</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="bankroll">Required Bankroll</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="variance">Variance Sim</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="kelly">Kelly Criterion</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="stack">Effective Stack</button>
  </div>

  <!-- Pot Odds Calculator -->
  <div class="tab-content active" id="tab-pot-odds">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Pot Odds Calculator</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">What price are you getting?</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        Calculate the pot odds you're getting on a call, and the minimum equity you need for it to be profitable.
        Compare your hand equity to this number — if your equity is higher, the call is +EV.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Pot size</label>
          <input type="number" id="po-pot" value="100" min="0" step="any" />
          <div class="field-help">Total pot before villain's bet</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Bet to call</label>
          <input type="number" id="po-bet" value="50" min="0" step="any" />
          <div class="field-help">Villain's bet you're facing</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="calcPotOdds()">Calculate</button>

      <div class="result-grid mt-5">
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Pot odds</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="po-ratio">3 : 1</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="po-pct">25.0%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Required equity</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="po-required">25.0%</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="po-explain">Need 25% to break even</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Outs to Equity -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-outs">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Outs to Equity</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">How often do you hit your draw?</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        Convert your outs into approximate equity using the rule of 4 (turn + river) or rule of 2 (single street).
        Quick mental math at the table.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Number of outs</label>
          <input type="number" id="outs-count" value="9" min="0" max="47" step="1" />
          <div class="field-help">Cards that improve to a winner (max 47)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Streets remaining</label>
          <select id="outs-street">
            <option value="2">Both (turn + river)</option>
            <option value="1" selected>One street only</option>
          </select>
          <div class="field-help">Most common: facing turn bet</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="calcOuts()">Calculate</button>

      <div class="result-grid mt-5">
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Approximate equity</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="outs-equity">19.6%</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="outs-rule">Rule of 2: outs × 2</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Exact equity</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="outs-exact">19.6%</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="outs-formula">9 of 46 cards</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tournament ROI -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-roi">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Tournament ROI Calculator</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Are you actually winning?</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        Calculate your tournament ROI from total buy-ins and total cashes. Honest number.
        Most live MTT players think they're winning more than they actually are.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Tournaments played</label>
          <input type="number" id="roi-played" value="50" min="1" step="1" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Average buy-in (₱)</label>
          <input type="number" id="roi-buyin" value="5000" min="0" step="any" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Total cashes (₱)</label>
        <input type="number" id="roi-cashes" value="320000" min="0" step="any" />
        <div class="field-help">Sum of all your money won, gross</div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="calcROI()">Calculate</button>

      <div class="result-grid mt-5">
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">ROI</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="roi-pct">28.0%</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="roi-status">Profitable</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Net profit</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="roi-profit">₱70,000</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="roi-perTourney">₱1,400 per tournament</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Required Bankroll -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-bankroll">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Required Bankroll</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Can you afford the swings?</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        Compute the bankroll needed to play your stake at a target risk of ruin, given your win rate and standard deviation.
        Industry-standard for cash games: ~30 buy-ins for low-stakes, 50+ for higher.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Win rate (bb/100)</label>
          <input type="number" id="br-winrate" value="5" step="0.1" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Std deviation (bb/100)</label>
          <input type="number" id="br-stddev" value="100" step="any" />
          <div class="field-help">Live cash typical: 70–110</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Target risk of ruin</label>
          <select id="br-ror">
            <option value="0.01">1% (conservative)</option>
            <option value="0.05" selected>5% (standard)</option>
            <option value="0.10">10% (aggressive)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Big blind size (₱)</label>
          <input type="number" id="br-bb" value="200" min="0" step="any" />
          <div class="field-help">e.g., ₱100/200 game = 200</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="calcBankroll()">Calculate</button>

      <div class="result-grid mt-5">
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Required bankroll</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="br-amount">₱600,000</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="br-buyins">30 buy-ins (at 100bb)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">In big blinds</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="br-bbs">3,000 bb</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="br-formula">Formula: σ²·ln(1/ROR) / (2·WR)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Variance Simulator -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-variance">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Variance Simulator</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">What does the swing look like?</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        Monte Carlo simulation of 10,000 sample runs at your win rate and standard deviation.
        Shows what 90% of outcomes look like at the end of your sample size.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Hands</label>
          <input type="number" id="var-hands" value="100000" min="100" step="any" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Win rate (bb/100)</label>
          <input type="number" id="var-winrate" value="5" step="0.1" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Std deviation (bb/100)</label>
        <input type="number" id="var-stddev" value="100" step="any" />
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="runVariance()">Run 10,000 simulations</button>

      <div id="var-results" class="mt-5" style="display:none;">
        <div class="result-grid">
          <div class="result">
            <div class="result-label">Expected outcome</div>
            <div class="result-value" id="var-expected">+5,000 bb</div>
            <div class="result-extra">Win rate × hands ÷ 100</div>
          </div>
          <div class="result">
            <div class="result-label">Risk of losing money</div>
            <div class="result-value" id="var-risk">12.7%</div>
            <div class="result-extra">% of runs ending negative</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card rounded p-5 mt-4">
          <div class="label mb-3">Outcome distribution</div>
          <div id="var-distribution"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Kelly Criterion -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-kelly">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Kelly Criterion</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Optimal bet sizing.</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        Calculate the mathematically optimal bet size as a fraction of your bankroll given your edge.
        For poker stakes selection, "Half-Kelly" (50% of full Kelly) is a common conservative variant.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Win probability (%)</label>
          <input type="number" id="kelly-prob" value="55" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" />
          <div class="field-help">Your equity / hit rate</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Odds offered (decimal)</label>
          <input type="number" id="kelly-odds" value="2" min="1" step="0.01" />
          <div class="field-help">2 = even money, 3 = 2:1, etc.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="calcKelly()">Calculate</button>

      <div class="result-grid mt-5">
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Full Kelly</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="kelly-full">10.0%</div>
          <div class="result-extra">% of bankroll to bet</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Half Kelly (recommended)</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="kelly-half">5.0%</div>
          <div class="result-extra">50% of full Kelly</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Effective Stack -->
  <div class="tab-content" id="tab-stack">
    <div class="tool-card featured">
      <div class="label mb-2">Effective Stack</div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">How deep is the actual play?</h2>
      <p class="text-2 text-sm mb-5">
        The effective stack between two players is the smaller of the two — that's the amount actually in play.
        Convert to big blinds for instant context.
      </p>

      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Your stack</label>
          <input type="number" id="es-hero" value="20000" min="0" step="any" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Villain's stack</label>
          <input type="number" id="es-villain" value="35000" min="0" step="any" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label>Big blind size</label>
        <input type="number" id="es-bb" value="200" min="0" step="any" />
      </div>

      <button class="btn-orange w-full py-3 rounded mt-2" onclick="calcStack()">Calculate</button>

      <div class="result-grid mt-5">
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">Effective stack</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="es-eff">20,000</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="es-context">You are the shorter stack</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result">
          <div class="result-label">In big blinds</div>
          <div class="result-value" id="es-bbs">100 bb</div>
          <div class="result-extra" id="es-depth">Standard cash depth</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- More tools coming -->
<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <div class="label mb-3">Coming Soon</div>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold">More tools shipping every month.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5"><div class="orange text-2xl mb-2">♠</div><div class="font-serif">Equity Calculator</div><p class="text-3 text-xs mt-1">Hand vs. range and multi-way equity. Q3 2026.</p></div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5"><div class="orange text-2xl mb-2">♣</div><div class="font-serif">Preflop Charts</div><p class="text-3 text-xs mt-1">Full library: 6-max, 9-max, ICM-adjusted. Q3 2026.</p></div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5"><div class="orange text-2xl mb-2">♦</div><div class="font-serif">ICM Calculator</div><p class="text-3 text-xs mt-1">Final-table ICM with future game adjustment. Q3 2026.</p></div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5"><div class="orange text-2xl mb-2">♥</div><div class="font-serif">Hand History Journal</div><p class="text-3 text-xs mt-1">Log, replay, and review hands from your sessions. Q4 2026.</p></div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5"><div class="orange text-2xl mb-2">♠</div><div class="font-serif">Live Cash Tracker</div><p class="text-3 text-xs mt-1">Bravo-style "what's running" feed. Mobile app, Q3 2026.</p></div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5"><div class="orange text-2xl mb-2">♣</div><div class="font-serif">Session Tracker</div><p class="text-3 text-xs mt-1">Bankroll over time, win rate by stake. Q3 2026.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="border-t border-soft">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="font-serif text-2xl orange leading-none">A</div>
        <div class="font-serif text-sm tracking-[0.18em]">ACESLIVE<span class="orange">PH</span></div>
